---
// Journey / parcours timeline — alternating left-right layout
---

<section class="journey" id="journey">
  <div class="container">

    <h2 class="section-title" data-reveal>
      <span class="lang-en">My Journey</span>
      <span class="lang-fr">Mon Parcours</span>
    </h2>
    <p class="section-subtitle glow-hover" data-reveal style="transition-delay:80ms">
      <span class="lang-en">From electronics bench to autonomous robots</span>
      <span class="lang-fr">De l’électronique aux robots autonomes</span>
    </p>

    <div class="timeline">

      <!-- 1 — LEFT -->
      <div class="timeline-item" data-reveal>
        <div class="timeline-content">
          <span class="timeline-date">2012 – 2016</span>
          <h3 class="timeline-title">
            <span class="lang-en">Federal VET Diploma — Electronics</span>
            <span class="lang-fr">CFC Électronique</span>
          </h3>
          <span class="timeline-place">CPLN, Neuchâtel</span>
          <p class="timeline-desc glow-hover glow-hover-nobg">
            <span class="lang-en">Built my hands-on foundation — circuit design, PCB assembly, analog & digital electronics, and my first embedded programs.</span>
            <span class="lang-fr">Bases pratiques — conception de circuits, assemblage PCB, électronique analogique & numérique, et premiers programmes embarqués.</span>
          </p>
          <a href="https://www.sbfi.admin.ch/en/vocational-education-and-training-vet" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="what-is-this lang-en">What is this?</a>
          <a href="https://www.sbfi.admin.ch/fr/formation-professionnelle-initiale" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="what-is-this lang-fr">C'est quoi ?</a>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
      </div>

      <!-- 2 — RIGHT -->
      <div class="timeline-item" data-reveal>
        <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
        <div class="timeline-content">
          <span class="timeline-date">2016 – 2017</span>
          <h3 class="timeline-title">
            <span class="lang-en">Federal Vocational Baccalaureate</span>
            <span class="lang-fr">Maturité Professionnelle</span>
          </h3>
          <span class="timeline-place">CPLN, Neuchâtel</span>
          <p class="timeline-desc glow-hover glow-hover-nobg">
            <span class="lang-en">Reinforced scientific curriculum in maths, physics and chemistry — the key to entering EPFL.</span>
            <span class="lang-fr">Cursus scientifique renforcé en maths, physique et chimie — la clé pour entrer à l'EPFL.</span>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 3 — LEFT -->
      <div class="timeline-item" data-reveal>
        <div class="timeline-content">
          <span class="timeline-date">2017 – 2018</span>
          <h3 class="timeline-title">
            <span class="lang-en">Preparatory Year (CMS)</span>
            <span class="lang-fr">Cours de Mathématiques Spéciales</span>
          </h3>
          <span class="timeline-place">EPFL, Lausanne</span>
          <p class="timeline-desc glow-hover glow-hover-nobg">
            <span class="lang-en">EPFL's one-year bridge program for VET graduates — intensive maths and physics to reach the level of a standard academic baccalaureate.</span>
            <span class="lang-fr">Programme passerelle d'un an de l'EPFL pour les titulaires d'un CFC — maths et physique intensifs pour atteindre le niveau de la maturité gymnasiale.</span>
          </p>
          <a href="https://www.epfl.ch/education/cms-preparatory-year/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="what-is-this lang-en">What is this?</a>
          <a href="https://www.epfl.ch/education/fr/cms/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="what-is-this lang-fr">C'est quoi ?</a>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
      </div>

      <!-- 4 — RIGHT -->
      <div class="timeline-item" data-reveal>
        <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
        <div class="timeline-content">
          <span class="timeline-date">2018 – 2021</span>
          <h3 class="timeline-title">
            <span class="lang-en">Bachelor in Microengineering</span>
            <span class="lang-fr">Bachelor en Microtechnique</span>
          </h3>
          <span class="timeline-place">EPFL, Lausanne</span>
          <p class="timeline-desc glow-hover glow-hover-nobg">
            <span class="lang-en">Mastered mechanics, electronics, control theory and signal processing. Deep dives into embedded systems, C programming and automation.</span>
            <span class="lang-fr">Maîtrise de la mécanique, électronique, théorie du contrôle et traitement du signal. Plongée en systèmes embarqués, programmation C et automatisation.</span>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 5 — LEFT -->
      <div class="timeline-item" data-reveal>
        <div class="timeline-content">
          <span class="timeline-date">2021 – 2024</span>
          <h3 class="timeline-title">
            <span class="lang-en">Master in Robotics — Minor Space Technologies</span>
            <span class="lang-fr">Master en Robotique — Minor Technologies Spatiales</span>
          </h3>
          <span class="timeline-place">EPFL, Lausanne</span>
          <p class="timeline-desc glow-hover glow-hover-nobg">
            <span class="lang-en">Focused on autonomous systems, FPGA embedded design (Intel SoC, VHDL), deep learning, model predictive control, legged and aerial robotics — with a Space Technologies minor covering spacecraft design and satellite positioning.</span>
            <span class="lang-fr">Systèmes autonomes, conception FPGA embarqué (SoC Intel, VHDL), apprentissage profond, contrôle prédictif, robots à pattes et aériens — avec un mineur en Technologies spatiales couvrant la conception de satellites et le positionnement GNSS.</span>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-dot timeline-dot--accent"></div>
      </div>

      <!-- 6 — RIGHT -->
      <div class="timeline-item" data-reveal>
        <div class="timeline-dot timeline-dot--current"></div>
        <div class="timeline-content">
          <span class="timeline-date">2024 – Present</span>
          <h3 class="timeline-title">
            <span class="lang-en">Robotics and Systems Integration Engineer</span>
            <span class="lang-fr">Ingénieur en Robotique et Intégration Systèmes</span>
          </h3>
          <span class="timeline-place">Wasteflow, Lausanne</span>
          <p class="timeline-desc glow-hover glow-hover-nobg">
            <span class="lang-en">Developing real-time control systems for industrial waste-sorting conveyors — translating AI decisions into precise physical actuation.</span>
            <span class="lang-fr">Développement de systèmes de contrôle temps-réel pour convoyeurs de tri industriel — traduire les décisions IA en actionnement physique précis.</span>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .journey {
    padding: 6rem 2rem;
  }

  .container {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .section-title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .section-subtitle {
    color: var(--color-text-dim);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
  }

  /* ── Timeline ── */
  .timeline {
    position: relative;
  }

  /* Center vertical line */
  .timeline::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    top: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    width: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(
      to bottom,
      transparent,
      var(--color-border) 6%,
      var(--color-border) 94%,
      transparent
    );
  }

  /* ── Each row ── */
  .timeline-item {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    margin-bottom: 5rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .timeline-item:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  /* ── Dot on center line ── */
  .timeline-dot {
    position: absolute;
    left: 50%;
    top: 0.45rem;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    width: 12px;
    height: 12px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #2a3040;
    border: 2px solid var(--color-accent-blue);
    z-index: 1;
    transition: background 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
  }

  .timeline-dot--accent {
    background: var(--color-accent-blue);
    border-color: var(--color-accent-blue);
  }

  .timeline-dot--current {
    background: #64d8ff;
    border-color: #64d8ff;
    box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(100, 216, 255, 0.5);
  }

  .timeline-item:hover .timeline-dot {
    background: var(--color-accent-blue);
    box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.5);
  }

  .timeline-item:hover .timeline-dot--current {
    box-shadow: 0 0 14px rgba(100, 216, 255, 0.75);
  }

  /* ── Content block ── */
  .timeline-content {
    padding: 0 2rem;
  }

  /* Odd items: content is first child (left column), text right-aligned */
  .timeline-item > .timeline-content:first-child {
    grid-column: 1;
    text-align: right;
    padding-right: 3.5rem;
    padding-left: 0;
  }

  /* Even items: content is last child (right column), text left-aligned */
  .timeline-item > .timeline-content:last-child {
    grid-column: 2;
    text-align: left;
    padding-left: 3.5rem;
    padding-right: 0;
  }

  .timeline-date {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-text-dim);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .timeline-title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-text);
    line-height: 1.35;
    margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
  }

  .timeline-place {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--color-text-dim);
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
  }

  .timeline-desc {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--color-text-dim);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .what-is-this {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.3rem;
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    padding: 0.35rem 0.8rem;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    color: var(--color-text-dim);
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 2rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease, background 0.2s ease;
  }

  .what-is-this::after {
    content: '↗';
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    opacity: 0.6;
  }

  .what-is-this:hover {
    color: var(--color-text);
    border-color: var(--color-text-dim);
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
  }

  /* Language visibility for what-is-this links */
  .what-is-this.lang-fr { display: none; }
  :global(:lang(fr)) .what-is-this.lang-fr { display: inline-flex; }
  :global(:lang(fr)) .what-is-this.lang-en { display: none; }

  /* ── Mobile: collapse to single right column ── */
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .timeline::before {
      left: 10px;
      transform: none;
    }

    .timeline-item {
      display: block;
      padding-left: 2.25rem;
    }

    .timeline-dot {
      left: 4px;
      transform: none;
    }

    .timeline-item > .timeline-content:first-child,
    .timeline-item > .timeline-content:last-child {
      grid-column: unset;
      text-align: left;
      padding-left: 0;
      padding-right: 0;
    }
  }
</style>
